1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:02,291
He threw us out like garbage.

2
00:00:02,625 --> 00:00:04,208
Stripped me of everything.

3
00:00:04,208 --> 00:00:06,958
Why should I care
if he lives or dies?

4
00:00:09,833 --> 00:00:12,250
He's a cold-blooded bastard.

5
00:00:12,250 --> 00:00:14,625
I'm doing this for you.

6
00:00:15,333 --> 00:00:16,791
Yes, he kicked you out.

7
00:00:16,791 --> 00:00:19,500
But you are still the
rightful heir of House Carter.

8
00:00:19,500 --> 00:00:22,416
Those lands, that title, everything, it belongs to you.

9
00:00:22,416 --> 00:00:23,666
Only you.

10
00:00:23,666 --> 00:00:26,166
I don't want any of that worthless junk.

11
00:00:26,833 --> 00:00:29,291
But I will not
let that scheming half-brother

12
00:00:29,291 --> 00:00:31,333
of yours steal
what belongs to you.

13
00:00:31,750 --> 00:00:34,416
Not while I'm still breathing!

14
00:00:40,916 --> 00:00:44,791
So my pathetic brother
still won't break the engagement?

15
00:00:46,625 --> 00:00:48,666
He wants to humiliate himself.

16
00:00:48,666 --> 00:00:50,291
I'm happy to give it to him.

17
00:00:50,500 --> 00:00:52,125
Get yourself ready.

18
00:00:53,041 --> 00:00:54,208
At the wedding,

19
00:00:54,208 --> 00:00:56,875
I'll announce that you are my real husband.

20
00:00:57,541 --> 00:01:00,541
I'll make Severin the laughingstock of all Emeraldstone.

21
00:01:00,541 --> 00:01:02,625
Come on, you
two grew up together.

22
00:01:02,625 --> 00:01:05,375
That's pretty harsh, even for you.

23
00:01:06,083 --> 00:01:08,625
If he wants to cling
on like a stray dog,

24
00:01:08,625 --> 00:01:10,958
he deserves what's coming.

25
00:01:10,958 --> 00:01:13,208
I can't wait for that wedding.

26
00:01:16,208 --> 00:01:19,625
And the second the
old man stops breathing,

27
00:01:19,625 --> 00:01:22,416
everything in House Carter becomes mine.

28
00:01:22,416 --> 00:01:23,625
Not only that.

29
00:01:23,625 --> 00:01:25,458
Oh, it's better than that.

30
00:01:25,458 --> 00:01:26,916
The Sovereign Sanctum

31
00:01:26,916 --> 00:01:28,000
has promised to elevate

32
00:01:28,000 --> 00:01:30,375
me above the Four Great Families.

33
00:01:30,375 --> 00:01:33,500
I will rise
as a new goddess.

34
00:01:34,166 --> 00:01:36,833
Then you better make
sure you show proper...

35
00:01:36,833 --> 00:01:38,833
gratitude to Steward Jeyn.

36
00:01:38,833 --> 00:01:40,583
Once we lock in that connection,

37
00:01:40,583 --> 00:01:44,250
every noble across Golantis will
bend the knee to us.

38
00:01:55,625 --> 00:01:57,041
The demonic energy

39
00:01:57,041 --> 00:02:00,291
has ravaged the Count's organs.

40
00:02:01,541 --> 00:02:03,625
Is there...

41
00:02:03,791 --> 00:02:05,041
any hope?

42
00:02:05,291 --> 00:02:08,750
There is only one
man capable of saving you.

43
00:02:08,750 --> 00:02:09,958
Who?

44
00:02:09,958 --> 00:02:12,666
The one who has
withdrawn from the world.

45
00:02:13,083 --> 00:02:15,291
The Godfather.
